  id: pyotr_ilyich_tchaikovsky
  category: bandas musicales
  difficulty: 1
  answer: Pyotr Ilyich Tchaikovsky
  acceptedAnswers:
  - Pyotr Ilyich Tchaikovsky
  hints:
  - "Su cat\xE1logo registrado incluye \xABThe Seasons, Op. 37a, TH 135: 10. October:
    Autumn Song (Arr. for Violin and Piano by Charles Cern\xE9)\xBB, de 1929, y llega
    hasta 2008."
  - "\xABNutcracker Suite, Op.71a, TH.35 (Arr. For Piano 4-Hands): 2. Danses caract\xE9ristiques.
    a. Marche: Tempo di marcia viva\xBB presenta una energ\xEDa suave y un pulso
    cercano a 107 BPM."
  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xAB1812 Overture\xBB y \xABThe Nutcracker (Suite),
    Op. 71a, TH. 35: 2b. Dance Of The Sugar-Plum Fairy\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xABAlbum for the Young, Op. 39: No. 3. Mamma (Maman)\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABSerenade for Strings in C major, Op.
    48: II. Walzer: Moderato, tempo di valse\xBB y \xABThe Nutcracker, Op.71, TH.14
    / Act 2: No. 12b Coffee (Arabian Dance)\xBB."
